Normal\">&nbsp;</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Hollis Jacobsen – Manager of Information Technology</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Foothills County - <a href=\"mailto:hollis.jacobsen@foothillscountyab.ca\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">hollis.jacobsen@foothillscountyab.ca</span></a></span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Zach Adolphe &lt;zacha@swiftlearning.com&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Monday, September 15, 2025 12:53 PM<br><b>To:</b> Hollis Jacobsen &lt;Hollis.Jacobsen@FoothillsCountyAB.ca&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Kim Adolphe &lt;kim@swiftlearning.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Quick Chat Regarding a Few Items</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Hi Hollis,&nbsp;</span></p></div><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin-right:0in; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"color:black\">Hope the remainder of your summer and the labour day weekend was great! &nbsp;We’ve had a couple great meetings with your counterpart Doug as you are aware. We were hoping we could have a quick chat with you to clarify our understanding for the discovery and classification projects for the budget, and a couple of other items so we can plan accordingly.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin-right:0in; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"color:black\">Would you be available for a quick zoom chat this week?</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin-right:0in; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin-right:0i